## Frontend-Backend Integration

### Move Transmission

When sending moves between frontend and backend:

1. **Frontend to Backend**:
   ```typescript
   interface PlaceStoneRequest {
     roomId: string;
     x: number;
     y: number;
     color: "black" | "white";
   }
   ```

2. **Backend to Frontend**:
   ```typescript
   interface BoardUpdateEvent {
     board: number[][];
     lastMove: { x: number, y: number };
     captures: { black: number, white: number };
     currentPlayer: "black" | "white";
   }
   ```

### Board Component Integration

The `GoBoard` component should receive game state and callbacks:

```tsx
<GoBoard
  size={19}
  initialStones={boardState}
  interactive={isPlayerTurn}
  inGame={true}
  showCoordinates={true}
  currentPlayerColor={currentPlayer}
  onPlaceStone={(x, y) => {
    sendMove(gameId, x, y, currentPlayer);
  }}
/>
```

